@startuml
note across: Scenario 1 – Route Request and Candidate Generation\n""This sequence diagram illustrates the interactions between the user and the SafeNav system components when a user requests a safe route home. \nIn this scenario SafeNav only returns the route candidates as Graph Data.""

actor "User" as User
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Routing Engine" as RE
participant "Road Graph Access" as IGraph
participant "Data Management" as DM
participant "Map Services\n(MapAPI)" as MapAPI

alt Location ON and Go Home request
    User -> UI : Go Home request
    note right of User: Origin = Location, Destination = selection
else
    User -> UI : Origin and destination
end

note across: Call scenario 1 - reescale map to origin and destination

UI -> API : I_HTTP_Routes: create_route(RouteRequest)

API -> RE : I_Routing_Service: calculate_routes(request)

RE -> DM : I_Road_Graph_Access: getGraphData(area)

DM -> MapAPI : I_Map_Data_Access: fetchMapData(area)
MapAPI --> DM : I_Map_Data_Access:MapData

DM --> RE : I_Road_Graph_Access: GraphData

RE --> API : I_Routing_Service: RouteCandidates

alt Contextual evaluation
    note across: Scenario 3 will be triggered here for contextual route evaluation

else No contextual evaluation
   note across: Do nothing
end
API --> UI : I_HTTP_Routes: RouteResponse\n(routes only)

@enduml
